98],"cost_cuts":[2,0,2,2.99],"guidance":[2,2,0,2.99,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":1,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0922,"r5":-0.1025,"r1_spy":-0.0745,"r5_spy":-0.0552}}],"quotes":[{"c":"GTES 2017 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2018-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"…mode and I think you'll see that transfer more to BA/BE activities where we'll try to get cost out of the product and introduce products that are more efficient from a manufacturing perspective. So, I think that is where Gates Operating System transitions, too, as well as influencing the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/13/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2017-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2018 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2019-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"…we have set up pretty nicely to weather the current automotive first-fit weakness and frankly the trade war headwinds and, look, as David noted, we believe that we see some further deceleration in China, particularly in Q1, and this current environment, frankly, is contemplated in our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/12/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2018 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2019-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Joshua Pokrzywinski","x":"Was there any one who is on the other side of it, who is perhaps pre-buying ahead of tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/12/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2018 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2019-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jerry Revich","x":"So, Ivo, I just wanted to better understand the cost savings that you folks are going to achieve what -- on this Turkey example or another example of switching from a smaller facility toward the new campus approach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/12/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"This view is not reflective of any potential trade war escalation between the U.S. and China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"We did maintain positive price cost with our pricing exceeding raw material inflation and direct tariff impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"These actions include some rooftop consolidations within our operations footprint, streamlining of some activities as we drive globalization of certain functions, and the establishment of certain shared service back office functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"We have also previously discussed driving further productivity through streamlining G&A, and these other actions are aligned with doing that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"The slower start to the year that we discussed today has resulted in us reducing our annual guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Kaplowitz","x":"You've mentioned ag a few times, obviously there's still some tariff-related noise around ag, so how much have you discounted the risk in ag in particular?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"In addition to productivity initiatives and managing compressible operating costs and G&A expenses, our recent footprint investments helped position us to accelerate and expand upon our previously announced restructuring program, which David will cover in more detail in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Naemura","x":"I will touch more on the additional actions we are taking in response to lower revenue levels when I discuss our restructuring plans later in this presentation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"And last month we announced the first impacted facility that is part of our fixed cost restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"As we discussed on our last call the recent investments made in our footprint are enabling us the execution of our expanded restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2019-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Therefore we are maintaining the guidance that we communicated in the previous quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Our teams have made solid progress addressing compressible manufacturing costs across our footprint and our previously announced fixed cost restructuring initiatives are progressing well, positioning the company for improvement in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2019 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"…pressure to continue in Q1 of this year, but anticipate seeing quarterly sequential improvements as the year progresses, a result of volume increasing from both growth initiatives and improving end market conditions and savings associated with our fixed cost restructuring actions kicking in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"The margin decline was broadly in line with the expectations communicated on our Q4 earnings call and represents an improved decremental margin relative to Q4 and full-year 2019, a result of the progress we have made in rightsizing the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Reflecting the progress we have made last year in rightsizing the business, we would expect the full year decremental margins to be an improvement from what we saw in 2019, despite the relatively unexpected and significant decline in revenue as a result of the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"We continued to make progress on our restructuring plan we announced last year taking two further actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"The improved detrimental margin from Q1 is primarily the result of cost reduction actions we have taken, enhanced productivity and favorable product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Waelke","x":"We are seeing the benefits of actions we took in 2019 to right size the business and the flexible posture we have maintained has served us well, as we have been highly responsive to improvements in demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"We maintain our expectations that these actions, along with the operational efficiencies from our new plants and savings from our restructuring program will result in solid incremental margins as we return to growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2020-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2021-02-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"…our raw material costs and we certainly are very confident that we will be able to offset any raw material inflation with actions that we have taken either by new products that are more efficient, they're using less raw material to perform the same function and/or positive price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/08/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Additionally, our restructuring program is proceeding well and it will deliver more significant savings later this year, aligned with the plan we originally laid out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/08/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2020 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2021-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"We are driving significant operational productivity and thoughtfully managing price material economics through our Gates operating system, which in combination with the savings from our restructuring program, we expect to contribute to additional margin expansion in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/08/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2021-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"The margin expansion was a result of productivity initiatives, continued benefits from our restructuring activities and efficiencies from higher volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"As a result of our performance to date and the supportive trends we are seeing in our end markets, we are again raising our full-year guidance, which Brooks will provide further detail on later in the presentation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2021-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brooks Mallard","x":"Based on the current healthy trends in our business, we are again raising our full-year guidance after a significant increase in our first quarter earnings release.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2021-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"And since it was so close to announcing our standardized price increases in Q4, we waited to do that, not to disrupt all the price books and all the issues that come with rolling forward pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2021-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brooks Mallard","x":"But I will give you -- I will tell you that if we see further acceleration as we did in kind of midway through 2021, we can roll out additional price increases next year to make sure that we stay on top of this price/cost dynamic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2021-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Our innovation efforts and key growth initiatives are focused on higher-margin products, which we believe in combination with restructuring benefits and ongoing GPS-based productivity initiatives provide additional margin expansion opportunity over the midterm.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2021 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2021-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"We want to make sure that we scope the right size of pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/gates-industrial-corporation-plc-gtes-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Our in-region, for-region operational structure is proving itself effective, as the enacted tariffs continue to fluctuate, and we have been able to mitigate the impact on our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brooks Mallard","x":"Before I turn the call over to Ivo, I'll provide a brief update on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"Concurrently, we remain highly focused on improving our gross margins through a mix of material cost savings, footprint optimization, and productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q2","e":"gtes","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brooks Mallard","x":"And so we're not gonna see the full throughput of some of our restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Deane Michael Dray","x":"And then as a follow-up, I was hoping you could take us through kind of the tariff impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Deane Michael Dray","x":"Pricing, and do you see any and it sounds like there could be some volume fall off because of some demand destruction but just kind of where does tariffs stand on a net basis?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tomo Sanyal","x":"Could you talk about how you have been in passing through cost inflation in Q3?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"Our restructuring cash outflows have increased, which impacted our free cash flow conversion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q3","e":"gtes","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"We have lowered our free cash flow conversion outlook to a range of 80% to 90% from 90% plus as a result of increased restructuring cash outlays as part of our footprint optimization and restructuring initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/gates-industrial-gtes-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"So we have got some carryover tariff pricing that is still in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/gates-industrial-gtes-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"One thing that we look at, you look at tariffs, you look at utilities, you look at material, but also you have heard me talk about labor inflation as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/gates-industrial-gtes-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"Of note, our 2025 free cash flow conversion included over $30 million of cash restructuring related to footprint optimization initiatives and other restructuring, which is above average spending for our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/gates-industrial-gtes-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2025 Q4","e":"gtes","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"L. Brooks Mallard","x":"We project 90% plus free cash flow conversion assuming above average spending on CapEx and cash restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/gates-industrial-gtes-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2026 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2026-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ivo Jurek","x":"In addition, we do not anticipate any material financial impact from the recent revisions in Section 232 tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/gates-gtes-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2026 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2026-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Tarantino","x":"And maybe give us some color on price costs relative to the increased inputs, particularly around any oil derivative impacts or any tariff impacts you expect moving forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/gates-gtes-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2026 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2026-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"L. Mallard","x":"This led to slightly lower-than-expected revenues, of around $4 million, and higher pass-through backlog than normal as we exited Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/gates-gtes-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GTES 2026 Q1","e":"gtes","d":"2026-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"L. Mallard","x":"We've begun to roll out some price increases and then we're looking at the impact of some other things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/gates-gtes-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},